      "reading": "作者原文PDF §2–3、GLM noising regularizer，已读",
      "known": "对无偏feature corruption积分可写为GLM经验损失加无标签adaptive regularizer；二阶近似联系Fisher加权L2与AdaGrad。",
      "collision": "R11的tr(M_Q A N A^T)作为由设计扰动诱导的方向相关正则，属于已有noising-as-regularization脉络；不能叫新的noise learning定理。",
      "difference": "Wager处理feature dropout等人工扰动，R11拟对support label-count-preserving score perturbation精确取covariance，并用future M_Q作role-coupled惩罚；这只构成限定的结构差异。",
